  "details": "i have a great idea guys how about we get an option to customize our menu layout for free and we can set our key binds as we'd like that way no one is going to get upset from future menu updates\n\nthat way no issues for anyone\n\nGive us the option to set up our menus as we like layout wise and button wise sorta like the old windows widgets or something like that where there is different sized buttons that snap to a grid\n\nGive us the option to set our keybinds as what we would like, self explanatory\n\nLegacy Menu Options so if someone prefers the older menu let that have that style but have it be able to customize it like said about to work with current things being added\n\nand most importantly without having to pay for it or have VRC+ for basic ui functions\n\nthis stuff was standard back in 2006 its 2025 can we please just the option after so many years of asking for it please",
